  "contentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"module-heading\">Chapter 3: People</h1><p class=\"ov-source\">Source: Managing Successful Projects with PRINCE2, chapter 3.</p>\n<div class=\"scenario-box\">\n<p><em>The atmosphere in the SnakeBite team is becoming tense. Developer Bartek does not want to work with designer Tomek, claiming that the retro style limits his coding ambitions. Maya, meanwhile, is afraid that the team will not understand the nostalgic atmosphere of earlier years.</em></p>\n<p><em>Zosia knows that a Gantt chart alone will not solve the relationship problems. She must apply leadership, take care of team culture, ensure effective communication, and guide people through change management.</em></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<h2 class=\"card-title\">👥 People: leading change, teams and communication</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--text-dark); margin-bottom:1rem; font-weight:600;\">\n          To resolve the conflict and guide change, Zosia considers leadership, the change management approach, team culture and communication.\n        </p>\n<div class=\"tile-grid\">\n<div class=\"flip-tile\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n<div class=\"flip-tile-inner\">\n<div class=\"tile-front\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"tile-icon\">👑</div>\n<div class=\"tile-title\">1. Leadership</div>\n<div class=\"tile-desc\">Motivating people, setting a vision, influencing others, and supporting the team.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flip-prompt\">🔄 Click for the definition</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tile-back\">\n<div class=\"tile-back-header\">\n<span class=\"tile-back-title\">Leadership</span>\n<span class=\"tile-back-badge\">People</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tile-back-body\">\n                  Motivating and influencing people. It differs from Management, which focuses on planning, organizing, and controlling processes.\n                </div>\n<div class=\"flip-prompt\">🔄 Click to return</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flip-tile\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n<div class=\"flip-tile-inner\">\n<div class=\"tile-front\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"tile-icon\">🔄</div>\n<div class=\"tile-title\">2. Leading change</div>\n<div class=\"tile-desc\">Change management helps people transition to the target organizational state.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flip-prompt\">🔄 Click for the definition</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tile-back\">\n<div class=\"tile-back-header\">\n<span class=\"tile-back-title\">Change management</span>\n<span class=\"tile-back-badge\">People</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tile-back-body\">\n                  The change management approach sets out the target organizational state and how people affected by the project will transition to it.\n                </div>\n<div class=\"flip-prompt\">🔄 Click to return</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flip-tile\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n<div class=\"flip-tile-inner\">\n<div class=\"tile-front\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"tile-icon\">🤝</div>\n<div class=\"tile-title\">3. Team culture</div>\n<div class=\"tile-desc\">Building trust, supporting diversity, and resolving conflicts.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flip-prompt\">🔄 Click for the definition</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tile-back\">\n<div class=\"tile-back-header\">\n<span class=\"tile-back-title\">Team culture</span>\n<span class=\"tile-back-badge\">People</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tile-back-body\">\n                  Shaping values, norms, and behaviours within the team. Building a climate where people can raise concerns and learn from mistakes.\n                </div>\n<div class=\"flip-prompt\">🔄 Click to return</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flip-tile\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n<div class=\"flip-tile-inner\">\n<div class=\"tile-front\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"tile-icon\">📢</div>\n<div class=\"tile-title\">4. Communication</div>\n<div class=\"tile-desc\">Two-way information exchange, active listening, and engagement.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flip-prompt\">🔄 Click for the definition</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tile-back\">\n<div class=\"tile-back-header\">\n<span class=\"tile-back-title\">Communication</span>\n<span class=\"tile-back-badge\">People</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tile-back-body\">\n                  Tailoring the message to the audience's needs. Essential for stakeholder management and building engagement.\n                </div>\n<div class=\"flip-prompt\">🔄 Click to return</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"remember-box\">\n<div class=\"remember-badge\">💡 Remember for the exam!</div>\n<div class=\"remember-text\">\n          People is an integrated element, not a separate practice or process. Chapter 3 covers context, leading successful change, leading successful teams and communication.\n        </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card quiz-section\">\n<h2 class=\"card-title\">SnakeBite Scenario: Managing People</h2>\n<div id=\"m2-story-quiz\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hard-knowledge-header\">\n<div class=\"hard-knowledge-title\">🎓 Hard knowledge for the Foundation exam (People)</div>\n<div class=\"hard-knowledge-subtitle\">Official definitions, documentation, and a general knowledge test.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hard-knowledge-content\">\n<div class=\"definition-item\">\n<div class=\"definition-term\">Change management approach</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 0.92rem; color: #334155; margin-top: 0.2rem;\">A management product within project initiation documentation that describes the target organizational state and how affected people will make the transition.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"definition-item\">\n<div class=\"definition-term\">Communication management approach</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 0.92rem; color: #334155; margin-top: 0.2rem;\">A management product within project initiation documentation specifying communication methods and frequency, including how stakeholders can give feedback.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quiz-section\">\n<div id=\"m2-exam-quiz\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;\"><h2 style=\"color: var(--accent-purple);\">🎴 Flashcards - Chapter 3</h2></div>\n<div class=\"flashcards-container\" id=\"m2-flashcards\"></div>\n",
